  "setup": "cp config.env.example config.env and set HEAD_IP/WORKER_IP (example link-local 169.254.x), ETH_IF, IB_IF. build-image.sh, copy-image-to-worker.sh, download-model.sh (huggingface-cli download on both nodes), then graft-mtp.sh, which runs lib/graft_mtp.py in the image on both nodes: it downloads the MTP shard(s) from stepfun-ai/Step-3.7-Flash (BF16), writes model-mtp.safetensors into the NVFP4 snapshot, updates the index, and extends the per-layer config lists. Containers start with --entrypoint= and 'sleep infinity'; the generated launch script is docker cp'd to /workspace/launch.sh and run with docker exec -d (worker first, head 5 s later). Passwordless SSH head->worker.",
